#: docs/proposals/app-platform.md:29
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<a0>{code0}</a0>: the client, a GitHub template app in Compose Multiplatform (Android, iOS, desktop, web from one tree). Screens are driven by configuration (SQL-on-FHIR {code1}s compiled at build time), data entry by SDC questionnaires. It opens on an OIDC login and blocks on a first sync with a FHIR server; there is no bundled-data mode."
msgstr "<a0>{code0}</a0>：客户端，一个基于 Compose Multiplatform 的 GitHub 模板应用（Android、iOS、桌面、Web 共用一棵代码树）。界面由配置驱动（在构建时编译的 SQL-on-FHIR {code1}），数据录入由 SDC 问卷驱动。它启动时显示 OIDC 登录，并在与 FHIR 服务器首次同步完成前阻塞；没有内置数据模式。"

#: docs/proposals/app-platform.md:35
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<a0>{code0}</a0>: the library behind it (configuration-driven FHIR views), usable on its own."
msgstr "<a0>{code0}</a0>：其背后的库（配置驱动的 FHIR 视图），可单独使用。"

