#: docs/proposals/app-platform.md:79
msgid "Requires an OIDC provider and a FHIR server to start; the offline mode is ours to write and to keep merging against a template that moves weekly."
msgstr "启动需要 OIDC 提供方和 FHIR 服务器；离线模式需要我们自己编写，并不断与每周都在变化的模板合并。"

#: docs/proposals/app-platform.md:95
msgid "Same current OHS libraries as the Player, so it demonstrates the stack the OHS Foundation is building towards, without the template's auth/sync/DI layer."
msgstr "与 Player 相同的最新 OHS 库，因此能展示 OHS Foundation 正在构建的技术栈，而没有模板的认证/同步/依赖注入（DI）层。"

